    "difficultyReason": "Connect symbolic perpendicular gradients to a circle equation, account for vertical-horizontal exceptions, and interpret the locus as the circle with diameter AB excluding its endpoints; earlier parts scaffold the algebra but leave the geometric connection to establish.",
